version:0.9
desc:J Dither
author: Stephen Boyes
about:
  # Normal TPDF dither???
  Features
  special shaped rectangular dither noise (x2 for TPDF).
  this magic dither uses one random bit, filtered to produce RPDF with a smooth
  and slightly tilted frequency responce, like a more subtle high pass dither.
  also fetures optional gental noise shaping.
changelog:
   - 0.9 less CPU


//   J dither
//  Featuring magic TPDF Dither
//
//  Noise shaping coeficiant calculations... RBJ and Hydrogen Audio
//  FLOAT 32 setting inspired by Airwindows Float Dither (this version uses all original code)
